## MachinesApi

### List machines
## List machines
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/machine/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get machine
## Get machine
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/machine/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
